  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water Treatment Plants Facility Arraijan  and  Sabanitas Panam&#xe1;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the Project is to support the construction of the Howard I and Sabanitas II Water Treatment Plants in the districts of Arraij&#xe1;n and Col&#xf3;n, Panama, and to provide Acciona and the Consortium with the financial flexibility needed to complete execution within the planned timeline, while ensuring operational continuity and minimizing the likelihood of any financial setbacks.The implementation of this Project aims to improve deficiencies in the drinking water service provided to the population of Panama, particularly in the districts of Arraij&#xe1;n and Col&#xf3;n, and to expand its coverage in the areas impacted by the initiative</narrative>
  </description>
